# CODEOWNERS — automatic review assignment.
#
# Each line maps a path pattern to one or more owners (GitHub usernames or
# teams). The LAST matching pattern wins. Owners listed here are automatically
# requested for review on PRs touching those paths, and branch protection can
# require their approval.
#
# Populate as the team forms. Examples:
#
# *                       @qalam/engineering
# /backend/               @qalam/backend-team
# /frontend/              @qalam/frontend-team
# /admin/                 @qalam/frontend-team
# /packages/ui/           @qalam/design-systems
# /infrastructure/        @qalam/platform
# /.github/               @qalam/platform
# /docs/                  @qalam/leads
